# Math Terminology Translation Rules

paths:
  - "**/*.tex"

---

## CRITICAL TRANSLATION RULES

| English | Chinese | Notes |
|---------|---------|-------|
| equivariant cohomology | 等变上同调 | "等变" NOT "等价" |
| equivariant quantum cohomology | 等变量子上同调 | "变量子" NOT "变上" |
| quantum cohomology | 量子上同调 | |
| Schubert polynomial | Schubert 多项式 | |
| flag variety | 旗流形 | |
| divided difference operator | 除差算子 | |
| Grassmannian | Grassmannian | 保持英文 |
| path diagram | Path 图 | |
| pipe dream | Pipe Dream | 保持英文 |
| dominant approximation | 主导近似 | |
| separated descents | separated descents | 保持英文 |

---

## COMMON MISTAKES TO AVOID

### ❌ WRONG
- 等价上同调 (should be: 等变上同调)
- 等上同调 (should be: 等变上同调)
- 等变量子 (should be: 等变量子上同调)

### ✅ CORRECT
- 等变上同调 (equivariant cohomology)
- 等变量子上同调 (equivariant quantum cohomology)
- 量子上同调 (quantum cohomology)

---

## TRANSLATION VERIFICATION

When encountering technical terms:
1. Check this table first
2. If unsure, search in original papers
3. Keep English for ambiguous terms (Grassmannian, Pipe Dream)
